              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Pre-deposit under S.112(8) CGST/JGST Act is 20% of disputed tax (cumulative - includes 10% from first appeal). Cap: Rs 20 crore each CGST and SGST. For penalty-only demands, 10%. Non-payment results in rejection at admission. Mining and steel disputes often involve high-value demands requiring careful planning."
