              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Can I appeal a Ranchi GSTAT order to the Jharkhand High Court?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "An appeal under S.113 lies to the Jharkhand High Court at Ranchi on questions of law. The GSTAT is the highest fact-finding authority. Only legal errors can be challenged. The Jharkhand HC is located in Ranchi, making further appeals conveniently accessible."
              }
