<!-- SECTION 3: WHAT IS [SERVICE] -->
<section class="content-section" id="what-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="two-column">
            <div class="column-content">
                <h2 class="section-title" id="what-is-section">What Is GSTAT Appeal Filing in Ranchi</h2><div class="highlight-box" style="background:var(--blue-lighter);border-left:4px solid var(--blue);padding:20px 24px;border-radius:var(--radius-md);margin-bottom:24px;"><p style="font-weight:600;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:4px;">Definition</p><p>GSTAT - the GST Appellate Tribunal - is the statutory forum under CGST Act S.109 for appeals against GST demand orders. The Ranchi bench covers all 24 Jharkhand districts. Businesses in Jamshedpur, Dhanbad, Bokaro, and Ranchi file appeals here under S.112.</p></div><p>The Ranchi GSTAT Bench was constituted under S.O.3048(E) dated 31 July 2024, with all Jharkhand districts notified under S.O.5063(E) dated 26 November 2024. Technical Member (Centre) Bijoy Bihari Mohapatra has been posted to Ranchi. Members were directed to join by 21 January 2026.</p><p>The bench serves India's mining powerhouse - Jharkhand is the largest producer of coal, iron ore, copper, mica, and bauxite. The CGST Ranchi Zone operates through two commissionerates covering the state, while the Commissioner of Commercial Taxes, Jharkhand handles state tax enforcement under the JGST Act. See <a href="/gstat-appeal-filing">GSTAT appeal filing services in India</a> for the national hub.</p><p><strong>Key terms:</strong> <a href="/gstat-appeal-filing">GSTAT appeal filing</a> | S.112 CGST Act | JGST Act | Form APL-05 | Pre-deposit under S.112(8) | Mining royalty GST | Ranchi CGST Zone</p>
            </div>
            <div class="column-image">
                <div class="illustration-placeholder" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F4F7FB 0%,#EEF2F7 100%);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:40px;text-align:center;min-height:240px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin:32px 0;"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 140" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:200px;height:140px;"><rect x="60" y="110" width="80" height="10" rx="3" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.15"/><rect x="70" y="50" width="60" height="25" rx="5" fill="#14365F"/><rect x="96" y="75" width="8" height="35" rx="3" fill="#E8712C"/><rect x="15" y="40" width="35" height="45" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="20" y="48" width="10" height="10" rx="1" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.3"/><rect x="33" y="48" width="10" height="10" rx="1" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.2"/><rect x="20" y="62" width="10" height="10" rx="1" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.2"/><rect x="33" y="62" width="10" height="10" rx="1" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.3"/><text x="32" y="92" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600">MINING</text><circle cx="160" cy="40" r="15" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.15"/><path d="M160 25c-5.5 0-10 4.5-10 10 0 7.5 10 18 10 18s10-10.5 10-18c0-5.5-4.5-10-10-10z" fill="#E8712C"/><circle cx="160" cy="35" r="4" fill="#fff"/><text x="160" y="68" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="#14365F" font-family="Barlow,sans-serif">Jharkhand</text></svg><span class="illustration-badge" style="display:inline-block;background:var(--orange-light);color:var(--orange);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:50px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;">GSTAT Appeal Filing - Ranchi Bench</span></div>
