    <div class="step-content" style="direction:ltr"><span class="step-badge">Step 6</span><h3 class="step-title">Final Hearing and Order</h3><p class="step-description">Represent at final hearing, file written submissions, obtain GSTAT order. Order pronouncement within 30 days. Appeal to the Jharkhand High Court at Ranchi under S.113 on a question of law. The Jharkhand HC is located in Ranchi - making further appeals conveniently accessible.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Order within 30 days</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Jharkhand HC at Ranchi</span></div></div>
