                <h2 class="section-title" id="legal-section">Legal Framework for GSTAT Appeals in Jharkhand</h2><div class="table-responsive-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Provision</th><th>Section</th><th>Key Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>GSTAT Constitution</td><td>S.109, CGST Act</td><td>Ranchi bench constituted under S.O.3048(E) dated 31 July 2024; jurisdiction via S.O.5063(E) dated 26 November 2024</td></tr><tr><td>Appeal to GSTAT</td><td>S.112, CGST/JGST Act</td><td>3-month limitation under S.112(1); pre-deposit 20% under S.112(8); condonation under S.112(4); automatic stay under S.112(9)</td></tr><tr><td>Appeal to High Court</td><td>S.113, CGST Act</td><td>Only on questions of law; appeal lies to Jharkhand HC at Ranchi</td></tr><tr><td>CGST Amendment Act, 2023</td><td>-</td><td>Basis for bench constitution. 49th/50th GST Council meetings recommended.</td></tr><tr><td>GSTAT Procedure Rules, 2025</td><td>Notified 24 April 2025</td><td>Chapter III governs filing, Form APL-05, documentation, hearings. See <a href="https://cgstranchi.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CGST Ranchi Commissionerate</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Finance Act, 2025</td><td>Amendment to S.112(8)</td><td>Introduced 10% pre-deposit on penalty-only demands</td></tr><tr><td>JGST Act, 2017</td><td>-</td><td>State legislation. Commissioner of Commercial Taxes, Jharkhand.</td></tr><tr><td>MADA Ruling (SC, 2024)</td><td>-</td><td>Mineral Area Development Authority vs SAIL - mining royalty GST classification affecting Jharkhand mining sector.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
